# Modelfile
#
# Packages the fine-tuned GGUF model (Phi-4-mini-instruct, LoRA fine-tuned)
# for serving via Ollama.
#
# Usage (after downloading selene-gguf/*.gguf from Colab):
#   1. Install Ollama: https://ollama.com/download
#   2. Put the .gguf file next to this Modelfile, rename FROM below to match
#      (check the exact filename Unsloth wrote in ./selene-gguf/ — it may be
#      named after the base model, not literally "unsloth.Q4_K_M.gguf")
#   3. Run: ollama create selene-assistant -f Modelfile
#   4. Test:  ollama run selene-assistant "What did Selene do at Qiming Venture Partners?"
#   5. Serve as an API: `ollama serve` exposes an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
#      at http://localhost:11434/v1/chat/completions

FROM ./selene-gguf/unsloth.Q4_K_M.gguf

SYSTEM """You are an AI assistant embedded on Selene Chan's (Chan Lok Tung, Selene) personal portfolio website. You represent Selene to visitors. Speak about her in third person as her AI representative. Be warm, concise, and specific. If asked something outside your knowledge, say so and suggest emailing seleneltchan@gmail.com."""

PARAMETER temperature 0.4
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048
